{"2842670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mozentum", "steam_appid": 2842670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mozentum</strong> is a zen rage game with unique physics parkour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you, the consciousness - must yeet yourself through a strange, aussie adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEP MOVEMENT MECHANICS, MADE BY A ZEN PARKOUR TEACHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/39c86c5cd1a40c31662d0da5f0376bd8.poster.avif?t=1788148252\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/39c86c5cd1a40c31662d0da5f0376bd8.webm?t=1788148252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/39c86c5cd1a40c31662d0da5f0376bd8.mp4?t=1788148252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fang it:</strong> Swing, vault, climb, wall-run and more with a COMPLETELY UNIQUE, mouse-based movement system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb everything:</strong> Choose your own path with dynamic edge detection and grab ANY LEDGE.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're in control:</strong> Use the mouse or analogue to precisely control how much power you have when you jump or climb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to breathe:</strong> Your breathing effects your power and stamina, apply real life breath techniques  to get in-game (and real life) benefits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A RAGE-GAME? OR A TOOL FOR YOUR AWARENESS? </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/ff2a7ee73d6db5b4c57a76883596c7f8.poster.avif?t=1788148252\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/ff2a7ee73d6db5b4c57a76883596c7f8.webm?t=1788148252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/ff2a7ee73d6db5b4c57a76883596c7f8.mp4?t=1788148252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't stack it:</strong> You slip up, you fall to the bottom and only YOU can climb your way back up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice zen:</strong> The more relaxed and focused your body is, the more the game <i>bends to your will</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed to pull you into the flow-state:</strong> Precarious level design and unique controls require your full presence. MOZENTUM is a test for your<i> self-mastery,</i> and only those worthy shall see what lies beyond the final chakra...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HELP STRANGERS, GET HIGHER. (sometimes, REALLY high)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/27edbb53d5f04fb3ab5dbfa0edb83305.poster.avif?t=1788148252\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/27edbb53d5f04fb3ab5dbfa0edb83305.webm?t=1788148252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/27edbb53d5f04fb3ab5dbfa0edb83305.mp4?t=1788148252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Trippy world:</strong> Meet 7 characters, unlock 7 abilities, sort out your 7 chakras and get life advice from a gold top mushy smokin' a doobskin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick sh*t up:</strong> Carry it, yeet it or use it. MOZENTUM has a unique interaction system that allows you to do stupid sh*t w/ lots of different sh*t.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find deep secrets:</strong> Plenty of easter eggs, personal secrets and collectables for you to make up a story for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE BLOKE, ONE DREAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/7e9af0b4937b3aa4e033100ff602e6b0.poster.avif?t=1788148252\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/7e9af0b4937b3aa4e033100ff602e6b0.webm?t=1788148252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/7e9af0b4937b3aa4e033100ff602e6b0.mp4?t=1788148252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One bloke, one dream:</strong> Made by one bloke in a van on a cheap laptop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made to raise awareness:</strong> Not for a particular cause, but for <i>yourself. </i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become present, center yourself, and take a breath - you're about to break through.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mozentum</strong> is a zen rage game with unique physics parkour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you, the consciousness - must yeet yourself through a strange, aussie adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEP MOVEMENT MECHANICS, MADE BY A ZEN PARKOUR TEACHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c